+    // 0067: Atlas-only ordering witness in the SAME append-only stream as
+    // Wine's +seh output. A separate log's line numbers/ticks cannot order
+    // Wine exceptions against map.start. Emit before the isolated marker;
+    // no exception can gain a larger startup allowance from this boundary.
+    if (!strcmp(stage, "map.start"))
